ayla","textMapHash":1336048394,"text":"In other words, it's probably just conducting research, and the nature of its research is very similar to mine.","nextNodeIds":[191530907]},{"nodeId":191530907,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":3071300746,"text":"The question that I submitted was no simple query, but it was able to give me a reply in just a day. This implies that it's familiar with a similar field of knowledge.","nextNodeIds":[191530908]},{"nodeId":191530908,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":2519158882,"text":"So, based on this reasoning, all we have to do is wait for it at the next astrological observation site.","nextNodeIds":[191530909,191530910]},{"nodeId":191530909,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":564855138,"text":"Your reasoning is solid.","nextNodeIds":[191530911]},{"nodeId":191530911,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":731509026,"text":"Ah, uh... It's nothing, really. There are actually some other factors that I've been speculating about...","nextNodeIds":[191530912]},{"nodeId":191530912,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":2184078658,"text":"But that's not important right now, let's get going. Even though we have a lead, it's still hard to say whether we'll be able to make any discoveries.","nextNodeIds":[191530913]},{"nodeId":191530913,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":512,"speakerName":"Layla","textMapHash":2704413290,"text":"I'll tell you what I mean by that if the Seelie doesn't show up...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":191530910,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1965381514,"text":"Look at you, finishing your thesis should be no problem at all.","nextNodeIds":[191530911]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA